==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 24~37.33 seconds<sup>720f~1,120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Upon starting, the player can stall the Pigges with a couple of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] and wait until they have maxed their [[Worker Cat]]. Once the base is damaged and the huge wave of Pigges are unleashed, the player can use a [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], along with a [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]]. If you have [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat/Paris Cat]], the level should be pretty easy.

